    "title": "Alexandre Birman's Uptown Soirée - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Elizabeth Kurpis ,\n1 days ago Once again, fashion and art collided as Alexandre Birman gathered longtime friends of the house to toast Fashion Month. Hosted by Guilherme Kfouri, Creative Director of Alexandre Birman, and author and tastemaker Carlos Mota, the evening was a reminder that sometimes the best excuse for a party is simply Fashion Week itself. The guest list was filled with women whose friendships have outlasted more than a few trend resurgences (read: hello early aughts for Spring 2027!), such as stylist Elizabeth Saltzman’s and Anne McNally’s friendship that stretches nearly four decades. Now that’s some fashion history. Read full article",
